Game assets
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

No game assets are distributed. This repository contains no Modern Warfare 2 data and no
commercial Doom IWAD. Freedoom (BSD-3-Clause) is downloaded on demand by
tools/fetch-freedoom.sh for development and is not committed.
